toddy"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet"},{"surface":"புகவின்","parts":[{"text":"புகவு","lemma":"புகவு","gloss":"feast"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the feast"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"தோட்டு","parts":[{"text":"தோட்டு","lemma":"தோட்டு","gloss":"of the group"}],"gloss":"of the group","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேட்டை","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டை","lemma":"வேட்டை","gloss":"hunt"}],"gloss":"hunt"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிரைய","parts":[{"text":"நிரை","lemma":"nirai","gloss":"row/abundance"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"-a","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"abundant/in rows"},{"surface":"ஒள்வாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒள்","lemma":"oḷ","gloss":"bright"},{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"vāḷ","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"bright swords"},{"surface":"இளைஞர்","parts":[{"text":"இளைஞர்","lemma":"இளைஞர்","gloss":"youths"}],"gloss":"youths","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருமகன்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"perumai","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"மகன்","lemma":"makaṉ","gloss":"son/leader"}],"gloss":"great leader"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அழிசி","parts":[{"text":"அழிசி","lemma":"aḻici","gloss":"Aḻici (a chieftain)"}],"gloss":"Aḻici"},{"surface":"ஆர்க்காடு","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்க்காடு","lemma":"ārkkāṭu","gloss":"Ārkkāṭu (a town)"}],"gloss":"Ārkkāṭu"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"anna","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"இவள்","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"ivaḷ","gloss":"this woman"}],"gloss":"this woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பழிதீர்","parts":[{"text":"பழிதீர்","lemma":"பழிதீர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாணலந்","parts":[{"text":"மாணலந்","lemma":"மாணலந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தொலைதல்","parts":[{"text":"தொலைதல்","lemma":"தொலைதல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்டே","parts":[{"text":"கண்டே","lemma":"கண்டே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Do not come to our street, O garlanded one who stood there! / She is becoming the subject of gossip, O Lord, like Kaveri's / great bathing ghat where many bathe, tied to the marutam trees, / with lofted-tusked elephants, of Cēntaṉ's father, / who has toddy feasts and packs of hunting dogs, / the great leader of youths with rows of bright swords, / Aḻici's town Ārkkāṭu, this woman, / seeing her blameless great beauty ruining.","translation":"Do not come to our street, O garlanded one, standing there! Gossip is arising, O Lord, about this girl. Seeing her blameless, great beauty fade away, people talk of her as they would of Ārkkāṭu, the town of Aḻici—the great leader of young warriors with rows of bright swords, who hunt with packs of dogs and feast on toddy, and the father of Cēntaṉ, who owns elephants with lofted tusks that are tied to the marutam trees at the great Kaveri ghat where many bathe.","modern":"மாலை அணிந்தவரே, அங்கே நிற்காதீர், எமது தெருவுக்கு வராதீர்! பலரும் நீராடும் காவிரியின் பெரிய துறையிலுள்ள மருத மரங்களில் கட்டப்பட்ட, உயர்ந்த தந்தங்களை உடைய யானைகளைக் கொண்ட சேந்தனின் தந்தையும், கள் விருந்தும் வேட்டை நாய் கூட்டமும் உடையவனும், வரிசையான ஒளிரும் வாள்களை ஏந்திய இளைஞர்களின் தலைவனுமாகிய அழிசியின் ஆர்க்காடு என்னும் ஊரைப் போல, இவளுடைய பழி அற்ற சிறந்த அழகு அழிவதைக் கண்டு, பெருமானே, இவளைப் பற்றி ஊரார் அலர் தூற்றுகின்றனர்.","explanation":"The friend of the heroine is speaking to the hero who has returned from his trysts with courtesans. The hero has been unfaithful, and his visits to the heroine's street are causing public gossip. The friend tells him not to stand in their street. The poem uses a rich description of the town of Ārkkāṭu, ruled by Aḻici (father of Cēntaṉ). The image of elephants with lofted tusks tied to the marutam trees at the busy Kaveri bathing ghat represents how the heroine's beauty is bound and exposed to public gaze and gossip, just like the elephants at the busy ghat. Key words include 'அலராகின்றாள்' (she becomes gossip), 'மாணலம் தொலைதல்' (ruining of great beauty), and 'வாரல் எம் சேரி' (do not come to our street).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,2.43],[2.43,2.63],[2.63,2.63],[2.63,2.7],[2.7,3.03],[3.1,3.7],[3.7,4.6],[4.6,5.0],[5.0,5.26],[5.26,5.9],[6.8,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.0,8.18],[8.24,8.3],[8.3,10.0],[10.0,10.1],[10.1,11.3],[11.3,11.37],[11.5,12.1],[12.1,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.2,13.43],[13.43,13.9],[13.97,14.2],[14.2,15.0],[15.0,15.8],[15.8,16.3],[16.3,16.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,3.17],[3.17,3.49],[3.49,3.49],[3.49,3.6],[3.6,3.93],[4.0,4.4],[4.4,4.4],[4.4,6.4],[6.4,6.69],[6.69,7.4],[7.4,8.67],[8.67,9.3],[9.3,9.6],[9.6,9.9],[9.9,10.08],[10.14,10.2],[10.5,11.9],[11.9,12.2],[12.2,13.6],[13.6,14.1],[14.1,14.6],[14.6,15.2],[15.2,15.8],[15.8,15.96],[15.96,15.98],[15.98,16.0],[16.0,16.0],[16.0,16.0],[16.0,19.4],[19.4,19.4]]},"sync":[[["வாரல்","do not come"],["எம்","our"]],[["சேரி","street"]],[["தாரன்","garlanded one"],["நின்றாரே","stood there"]],[["நின்றாரே","stood there"]],[["அலரா",""]],[["கின்றாற்",""]],[["பெரும",""]],[["காவிரிப்",""]],[["பலர்","many people"],["ஆடு","bathing"]],[["பெருந்துறை","great bathing ghat"]],[["மருதொடு","with the marutam trees"]],[["பிணித்த","tied to"]],[["ஏந்து","lofty"],["கோட்டு","of the tusk"]],[["கோட்டு","of the tusk"],["யானை","elephant"]],[["சேந்தன்","Cēntaṉ"]],[["தந்தை","father"]],[["அரியல்","toddy"],["அம்","sweet"]],[["புகவின்","of the feast"]],[["புகவின்","of the feast"],["அம்","beautiful"],["தோட்டு","of the group"]],[["வேட்டை","hunt"]],[["நிரைய","abundant/in rows"]],[["ஒள்வாள்","bright swords"]],[["இளைஞர்","youths"]],[["பெருமகன்","great leader"]],[["அழிசி","Aḻici"]],[["ஆர்க்காடு","Ārkkāṭu"]],[["ஆர்க்காடு","Ārkkāṭu"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["இவள்","this woman"]],[["பழிதீர்",""]],[["மாணலந்",""]],[["தொலைதல்",""]],[["கண்டே",""]]]}